    "text": "Carbon County, Wyoming\n18-Year-Old Wyomingite Dead, 3 Injured After Car Hits Elk, Rolls\nBy Joy Greenwald,\n8 hours agoAn 18-year-old Wyoming woman was killed and three other people injured early Monday morning when the car they were travelling in hit two elk and rolled, the Wyoming Highway Patrol says. It happened around 5:15 a.m. at milepost 15.2 on Wyoming 487 in Carbon County, north of Medicine Bow. According...",
